        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7035/A, Rectangular Keyed Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's 7 Inch Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set is one way to add security to a sliding door. The latch hooks into the door frame to secure the pocket door and is operated by a key from the exterior and by a thumbturn from the interior. It comes packaged with 2 flush pulls, a Schlage keyway, a keyed entry mortise box complete with retractable finger pull, the mortise faceplate, strike, and the mounting hardware. The Rectangular Keyed Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is available in a wide array of fantastic finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Keyed Lock:</b> Use when a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/7-inch-pocket-door-dummy-pull-omnia-7035-0\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/7-inch-pocket-door-passage-set-omnia-7035-n\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, and  <a href=\"/products/7-inch-pocket-door-privacy-set-omnia-7035-l\"><b>Privacy Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 7035 Pocket Door Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Case: Stamped from heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Front: Armored steel front adjustable for beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Schlage \"C\" keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Modern Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Height: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 1/2\" thick x 1-1/4\" high x 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Finger Pull: 1/2\" thick x 2\" high x 1-1/4\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-7035-specifications.pdf?v=1704262370\"><b>Omnia 7035 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a keyed mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "7 Inch Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set",
                "description": "Omnia's 7 Inch Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set is one way to add security to a sliding door. The latch hooks into the door frame to secure the pocket door and is operated by a key from the exterior and by a thumbturn from the interior. It comes packaged with 2 flush pulls, a Schlage keyway, a keyed entry mortise box complete with retractable finger pull, the mortise faceplate, strike, and the mounting hardware. The Rectangular Keyed Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is available in a wide array of fantastic finishes.",
